    {
      "index": 30,
      "locator": "Notebook 单元 30 · markdown",
      "text": "### 11.3.1 广义线性模型概述"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "locator": "Notebook 单元 31 · code",
      "text": "import numpy as np\nx=np.arange(1,20);x\ny=1/(1+np.exp(-(x-10)));y\nimport matplotlib.pyplot as plt  \nplt.plot(x,y,'o-');"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "locator": "Notebook 单元 32 · markdown",
      "text": "### 11.3.2  Logistic模型"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "locator": "Notebook 单元 33 · code",
      "text": "d115 = pd.read_excel('mvsData.xlsx','d115')  #读取例11.5数据 "
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "locator": "Notebook 单元 34 · code",
      "text": "import statsmodels.api as sm\nLogit=sm.GLM.from_formula('y~x1+x2+x3',family=sm.families.Binomial(),data=d115).fit() \nLogit.summary()                   #Logistic回归模型结果"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "locator": "Notebook 单元 35 · code",
      "text": "Logit_x1=sm.GLM.from_formula('y~x1',family=sm.families.Binomial(),data=d115).fit()\nLogit_x1.summary()"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "locator": "Notebook 单元 36 · code",
      "text": "#预测视力正常(x1=1)和视力有问题(x1=0)的司机发生事故概率\nLogit_x1.predict(pd.DataFrame({'x1':[1,0]})) "
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "locator": "Notebook 单元 37 · markdown",
      "text": "### 11.3.3 对数线性模型"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "locator": "Notebook 单元 38 · code",
      "text": "d116 = pd.read_excel('mvsData.xlsx','d116')  #读取例11.6数据 \nprint(d116)"
    },
