      "index": 39,
      "locator": "Notebook 单元 39 · code",
      "text": "Log=sm.GLM.from_formula('y~C(x1)+C(x2)',family=sm.families.Poisson(),data=d116).fit()\nLog.summary()                                #对数线性模型结果"
    },
